Here is a full changelog for v. 1.0.7.1:
- Fixed progress synchronization for daily tasks;
- 2x2 mode: now both members of winning team update their win stats in case of win;
- Added Dutch and Danish languages.

We want to say big "thank you" to all the people who helped us to find bugs and errors!
Enjoy playing the game ːsteamhappyː

