Update 1.0.6 is live now!
Here is a list of changes:
- We implemented some tools and tricks that would help us collect more data regarding game disconnects (hopefully it will help us deal with this issue in future);
- We've improved the way online rooms work (fixed bugs with players trying to join rooms that are about to begin play, fixed room timer reset, we also stop the room timer when person leaves the room);
- Prevent your dice resetting to default skin after disconnect;
- Some improvements of daily tasks;
- Fixed some errors while showing player avatars;
- Fixed some other minor bugs (the ones that are not worth mentioning).

We want to say big "thank you" to all the people who helped us to find bugs and errors!
enjoy playing the game :)

