Update 1.0.4 is out now!
Here is a full list of new changes:
- We prevented cheaters from exponentially increasing amount of chips on accounts;
- Fixed triple monopoly, line monopoly and resort monopoly achievements.
- Changes in process of buying new houses in 2x2 game mode: now your team mate does not take control over your property when improving your city. It is called voluntary investments!;
- We also fixed the price you actually pay when you do "voluntary investments"!;
- Your personal statistics are displayed correctly;

Thank you all for helping us find the mistakes!
Enjoyable game! ːsteamhappyː

