On July 25, we uploaded the game version 0.93.8. Full changelog below:
- New localizations: The italian language is added, Spanish and Chinese (Simplified) is updated;
- The daily quest "Buy out an opponent's area" is corrected. This means that the number of times has been reduced from 10 to 2;
- A description of the map "Chance" is fixed which helps you pass to the cage "World Tournament";
- A description of the world tour is fixed.

Thank you all for helping us find the mistakes!
Enjoyable game! :)

