This post is dedicated to everyone who's been waiting for new update - it's finally here!
You ask yourselves "what were they doing all that time?". Well, you know, we were preparing ourselves for this very day! The new features we created for you, they ripened in the sun, became juicy. And now they are fresh and juicy and finally ready to show themselves to the world!

And yes, we officially declare the start of summer season!
… Why? You still don't know what our new season is?!
So be the first to know all the details! Download the improved version 0.93 and enjoy the game! We have a large number of surprises in stock specially for you :)

By the way, we have even more great news. We introduce you the daily tasks. By completing these tasks, you can obtain gifts. And if you keep completing three task per day for several days in a row - your gifts would be much much better;)

Also we are eager to tell you the pleasing news: we were able to fix a large number of bugs in the game:
- game continues as normal after player leaves table;
- Names of friends are displayed correctly;
- Avatars of other players are displayed correctly;
- Some texts were corrected;
- Data storage systems improvements;
- Fixes of various minor bugs.

In general, we advise you to hurry;) Because every day matters! After all, the summer season will end when September ends.

That's what I understand - a hot offer!

